[img]{{header_old_paintings.png}}[/img]
[quote]Twenty-one damaged old paintings in five sets: the Old Valley, the Wreck, the Miners, Calico and the Dwarves
Dug from artifact spots, fished up in treasure chests, found in mine crates, the Skull Cavern and the Volcano, and now and then on the Travelling Cart
Your first is guaranteed from Painting level 3; take it to Gunther and he writes to the city
Margot restores them for a fee and posts them back; as a conservator you restore them yourself, painting the missing pieces back in from the whole picture
Lose one, sell one, trash one: it turns up again until the museum has it
Restored, they're worth far more than your own work[/quote]

