[img]{{header_the_museum.png}}[/img]
[quote]Donate restored paintings at Gunther's counter, framed or not (he gives the frame back)
The collection describes every painting, found or missing, and says where to look for the rest
Finish a set for its own frame style; the Old Valley brings a velvet rope, a gallery bench and a marble plinth
Six paintings bring a living painting, twelve bring Margot's loupe, and all twenty-one bring a paint-tube Junimo
The [b]Painting Wing[/b] opens after your first donation, with a place kept for every painting[/quote]

