[quote]Margot Pell (she/her), a conservator from the Zuzu City Museum of Art, who trained with Sable
She arrives a week after Gunther's letter, takes a room off the Saloon and works at the museum
Heart events at 2, 4, 6, 8, 10 and 14 hearts; at 4, Robin builds her a cottage by the river, and you choose what grows in its window box
Dateable and marriageable by anyone, with her own wedding, a conservation corner and a patio easel
At every festival, and she'll dance with you at the Flower Dance
She and Julian don't agree about restoration. At all.[/quote]

