Hundreds of lines of dialogue, a full schedule, every festival, and winter and island outfits
Their own room under the shop, down a trapdoor
Heart events at 2, 4, 6, 8, 10 and 14 hearts
A stall at the Night Market, all three nights, and a yard easel they paint at on Friday mornings
