[quote]A cottage shop in Cindersap Forest, west of the path down from Marnie's, on the world map
Canvases, pigments, paint, brushes, frames, palettes, varnish and more, with stock that grows with your skill
A yard easel, a commission board, a consignment gallery, your painting record, and a back room with a portfolio and a plan chest
