[img]{{header_selling_and_keeping.png}}[/img]
[quote]Sell to Pierre, to the art shop for more, or through the shipping bin; consign up to three at Sable's gallery for more again
A new subject sells for more; the same one over and over in a week, for less
Villagers' commissions on the shop's board
Everyone loves an iridium painting, and nobody dislikes one
Frame them to hang on your walls, in sixteen styles: small paintings take a single tile, and every frame helps the easels in its room
Varnish them in a Varnishing Cabinet, which cures them like wine in a cask
A painting record of every subject you've painted, and a portfolio book to fill[/quote]

